Package: skilldown
Title: Generate Documentation Websites for AI Agent Skill Collections
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Lars", "Schöbitz", , "lars@lse.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads a repository of AI agent skills (directories with a
    'SKILL.md' file carrying YAML frontmatter, following the
    agentskills.io specification), generates a Quarto website
    configuration around it (a home page from the README, a skills
    reference index from the frontmatter, articles from 'docs/', news
    from the changelog), and drives Quarto to render the site, the way
    'pkgdown' does for R packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/larnsce/skilldown
BugReports: https://github.com/larnsce/skilldown/issues
Imports:
    cli,
    fs,
    quarto,
    yaml
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
SystemRequirements: Quarto command line tool
    (<https://github.com/quarto-dev/quarto-cli>).
